// dws program completion matrix — the source of truth for `pnpm check:dws-completeness`.
//
// This file, not .planning/workstreams/dws/MATRIX.md, is what the done-gate reads: .planning/ is
// git-excluded, so a gate reading it would be unrunnable on any other checkout. MATRIX.md is a
// human view that points here.
//
// Only `state: "PASS"` closes a row, and only when it cites at least one `evidence` entry that
// resolves (an existing file path, or a package.json gate script name) — a PASS citing nothing, or
// citing something that does not resolve, is a checker failure, not a pass. Run the gate:
//   node config/scripts/check-dws-completeness.mjs   (or: pnpm check:dws-completeness)

